{"name": "s2", "dur": 43.1, "lines": [{"id": "v01", "t0": 0.35, "t1": 1.51, "clip": 0.29, "text": "你刷的每条视频，", "ch": [0.35, 0.495, 0.64, 0.785, 0.93, 1.075, 1.22, 1.365], "sub": null, "big": "你刷的每条视频，", "seg": "open", "src": ""}, {"id": "v02", "t0": 1.91, "t1": 3.43, "clip": 1.83, "text": "都是一串 0 和 1。", "ch": [1.91, 2.048, 2.186, 2.325, 2.463, 2.601, 2.739, 2.877, 3.015, 3.154, 3.292], "sub": null, "big": "都是一串 0 和 1。", "seg": "open", "src": ""}, {"id": "v03", "t0": 3.83, "t1": 7.71, "clip": 3.77, "text": "可在线上，连续五个 1 就是一条直线：四个，还是五个？", "ch": [3.83, 3.985, 4.14, 4.296, 4.451, 4.606, 4.739, 4.872, 5.005, 5.138, 5.271, 5.404, 5.537, 5.67, 5.803, 5.936, 6.069, 6.202, 6.335, 6.468, 6.624, 6.779, 6.934, 7.089, 7.244, 7.4, 7.555], "sub": "连续五个 1 = 一条直线", "big": null, "seg": "open", "src": ""}, {"id": "v04", "t0": 7.96, "t1": 13.17, "clip": 7.9, "text": "数错一个，数据就错了。而 AI 芯片每秒要这样数上千亿个，没人给它打拍子。", "ch": [7.96, 8.109, 8.258, 8.407, 8.555, 8.704, 8.853, 9.002, 9.151, 9.3, 9.449, 9.597, 9.73, 9.862, 9.994, 10.127, 10.259, 10.391, 10.524, 10.656, 10.788, 10.921, 11.053, 11.185, 11.318, 11.45, 11.582, 11.715, 11.847, 11.979, 12.128, 12.277, 12.426, 12.575, 12.723, 12.872, 13.021], "sub": "每秒上千亿个，没人打拍子", "big": null, "seg": "open", "src": ""}, {"id": "v05", "t0": 13.62, "t1": 16.88, "clip": 13.56, "text": "数清的关键，是知道每一位有多长：这就是节拍。", "ch": [13.62, 13.768, 13.916, 14.065, 14.213, 14.361, 14.509, 14.657, 14.805, 14.954, 15.102, 15.25, 15.398, 15.546, 15.695, 15.843, 15.991, 16.139, 16.287, 16.435, 16.584, 16.732], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": ""}, {"id": "v06", "t0": 17.13, "t1": 21.06, "clip": 17.08, "text": "它靠的是跳变：每次 0 变 1、1 变 0，就对一次表。", "ch": [17.13, 17.343, 17.556, 17.769, 17.981, 18.194, 18.407, 18.72, 18.804, 18.889, 18.973, 19.058, 19.142, 19.227, 19.311, 19.396, 19.59, 19.675, 19.76, 19.845, 19.93, 20.015, 20.27, 20.402, 20.533, 20.665, 20.797, 20.928], "sub": "每次跳变，对一次表", "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": ""}, {"id": "v07", "t0": 21.51, "t1": 24.25, "clip": 21.44, "text": "早了往后拨，晚了往前拨，几下就锁住了。", "ch": [21.51, 21.654, 21.798, 21.943, 22.087, 22.231, 22.375, 22.519, 22.664, 22.808, 22.952, 23.096, 23.241, 23.385, 23.529, 23.673, 23.817, 23.962, 24.106], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "reveal", "src": ""}, {"id": "v08", "t0": 25.4, "t1": 28.34, "clip": 25.34, "text": "然后在每一位正中间看一眼：五个，不是四个。", "ch": [25.4, 25.533, 25.666, 25.799, 25.932, 26.065, 26.198, 26.332, 26.465, 26.598, 26.731, 26.864, 26.997, 27.32, 27.453, 27.587, 27.84, 27.94, 28.04, 28.14, 28.24], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "reveal", "src": ""}, {"id": "v09", "t0": 28.79, "t1": 31.95, "clip": 28.73, "text": "可一长串全是 1，没有跳变，节拍就会跑偏。", "ch": [28.79, 28.913, 29.037, 29.16, 29.283, 29.407, 29.53, 29.653, 29.777, 30.0, 30.162, 30.324, 30.486, 30.648, 30.98, 31.119, 31.257, 31.396, 31.534, 31.673, 31.811], "sub": "没有跳变，节拍跑偏", "big": null, "seg": "reveal", "src": ""}, {"id": "v10", "t0": 32.2, "t1": 34.65, "clip": 32.13, "text": "所以发出前先把数据打乱，收到再还原。", "ch": [32.2, 32.336, 32.472, 32.608, 32.744, 32.881, 33.017, 33.153, 33.289, 33.425, 33.561, 33.697, 33.833, 33.969, 34.106, 34.242, 34.378, 34.514], "sub": "先打乱，再还原", "big": null, "seg": "reveal", "src": ""}, {"id": "v11", "t0": 35.1, "t1": 35.85, "clip": 35.04, "text": "一句话带走：", "ch": [35.1, 35.225, 35.35, 35.475, 35.6, 35.725], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "end", "src": ""}, {"id": "v12", "t0": 36.1, "t1": 38.65, "clip": 36.04, "text": "芯片不是在看 0 和 1，是在听节拍。", "ch": [36.1, 36.223, 36.346, 36.469, 36.592, 36.715, 36.838, 36.962, 37.085, 37.208, 37.331, 37.454, 37.577, 37.8, 37.942, 38.083, 38.225, 38.367, 38.508], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "end", "src": ""}, {"id": "v13", "t0": 38.9, "t1": 41.5, "clip": 38.84, "text": "下一条：芯片说速度翻倍，该问哪三句？", "ch": [38.9, 39.044, 39.189, 39.333, 39.478, 39.622, 39.767, 39.911, 40.056, 40.2, 40.344, 40.489, 40.633, 40.778, 40.922, 41.067, 41.211, 41.356], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "end", "src": ""}], "shots": [{"kind": "ribbon", "t0": 0, "paper": false, "first": "v01", "t1": 13.32}, {"kind": "beat", "t0": 13.32, "paper": false, "first": "v05", "t1": 28.49}, {"kind": "scramble", "t0": 28.49, "paper": false, "first": "v09", "t1": 34.8}, {"kind": "take", "t0": 34.8, "paper": true, "first": "v11", "type": [{"text": "一句话带走", "line": "v11", "from": null, "to": null}, {"text": "芯片不是在看 0 和 1，", "line": "v12", "from": "芯片", "to": "0 和 1"}, {"text": "是在听节拍。", "line": "v12", "from": "是在", "to": "节拍"}], "cy": 700, "t1": 43.1}], "hudIn": 13.32}